// # emit-x86 two println
//
// Logline: Print 1 then hi so emit-x86 can lower two sequential println statements.
//
// Setup: Product path is oodac emit-x86 on this file, then as and ld. No greet. No concat.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare main.
//   2. Print the const integer 1.
//   3. Print the const string hi.

pub fn main() {
    println(1);
    println("hi");
}
